# INVWINOD.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the assemblies,
# an item list with the item list's keys.  Items > Assemblies shows the
# empty text while no item has parts; with item 3 installed in item 2 and
# item 2 in item 1, it shows item 1 alone, titled Assemblies, and F1 the
# item lists' help (ITEMS), which ESC closes; ENTER shows it in view
# mode, which OK closes; Parts shows its parts, whose ESC goes back to
# the assemblies; Take out on it is refused as not installed; Move moves
# it to B2; INS shows a new item, which ESC leaves; ESC goes back to the
# item list; at level 1 the assemblies show and CTRL+E is refused; the
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINOD.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I A
S NONE
K ESC DOWN DOWN ALT-C I
T 2
K ENTER UP ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER ALT-I A
S ONE
K F1
S AHELP
K ESC ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ESC
S BACK
K ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S NOTIN
K ESC ALT-C M
T B2
K ENTER
S MOVED
K INS
S NEW
K ESC ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-I A
S READER
K CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER ALT-F X
